          "text": "```java\n/**\n * This test behaves slightly differently in Gson 2.2 and earlier. It fails\n * during peek rather than during nextString().\n */\npublic void testUnterminatedStringFailure() throws IOException {\n  JsonReader reader = new JsonReader(new StringReader(\"[\\\"unterminated\"));\n  try {\n    reader.beginArray();\n    assertEquals(JsonToken.STRING, reader.peek());\n\n    try {\n      reader.nextString();\n      fail(\"Expected MalformedJsonException for an unterminated string\");\n    } catch (MalformedJsonException expected) {\n      // Expected: the string has no closing quotation mark.\n    }\n  } finally {\n    reader.close();\n  }\n}\n```"
